@host = http://localhost:5170

### Créer une commande
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Alice Martin",
  "lines": [
    { "productName": "Clavier mécanique", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 89.90 },
    { "productName": "Souris", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 24.50 }
  ]
}

### Lister (pagination + filtre optionnel ?status=Pending)
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10

### Lire une commande (remplacer l'id)
GET {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Confirmer
POST {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm

### Health checks
GET {{host}}/health

###
GET {{host}}/alive
